Since we're talking about changes to the game that I think are MAJOR, then
I have a suggestion I haven't seen yet.

How about an U)ndo command to undo the last action - no matter what!  This
could prevent many of the complaints that have arisen about non-confirmed
things (after all you can just go back).  

Now, I know there are some things that should not be allowed to be undone.
Certainly acts that result in your death won't allow you to undo.  Certain
other things could be lumped in as well (I can't think of any right now).

Will that solve the problems (no, but it might move in that direction).

